 467  * Defining variables
 468  Positive Variables
 469  vteste(ipipe)
 470  q_edge(iedge)     volumetric flow rate
 471  k_edge(iedge)     massic flow rate
 472  f_pu(ipump,s)     pump head
 473  f_pi(ipipe,n)     pipe head loss per subsection
 474  f_he(ihe)         heat exchanger head loss
 475  q_circ(icirc)     volumetric flow rate per circuit
 476  lvalve(icirc)     valve head loss
 477  cpipe             annualized capital cost of the pipe sections
 478  cpump             annualized capital cost for the pumping system
 479  cpen              annualized overall penalization due higher outlet temper
      ature of hot fluid
 480  cope              overall operating cost of a pump
 481  cr(ihe)           heat capacity ratio
 482  U(ihe)            overall heat transfer coefficient
 483  h_w(ihe)          convection heat transfer coefficient of water
 484  h_hot(ihe)        convection heat transfer coefficient of hot fluid
 485  NTU(ihe)          number of transfer units
 486  epsilon(ihe)      effectiveness of a counter-current flow heat exchanger
 487  k_he_hot(ihe)     mass flow rate of hot fluid in heat exchanger
 488  T_w_feed          water temperature at cooling tower inlet
 489  T_w_base          water temperature at cooling tower outlet
 490  T_w_in(ihe)       water temperature at heat exchanger inlet
 491  T_w_out(ihe)      water temperature at heat exchanger outlet
 492  T_hot_out(ihe)    hot fluid temperature at heat exchanger outlet
